# HELIX frontend env (Vite / Vercel)
# All values below are OPTIONAL. The frontend works with zero env vars set —
# it reads everything live from X Layer mainnet via the public RPC.
#
# DO NOT put any private key in here. The frontend has no business with secrets.
# The deployer key lives in the project-root .env and is for forge/cast only.

# Override the X Layer mainnet JSON-RPC endpoint. Set this on Vercel if the
# public RPC is rate-limited or you want to point at a dedicated provider
# (e.g. a paid X Layer node). Unset → falls back to https://rpc.xlayer.tech.
# VITE_XLAYER_RPC_URL=https://rpc.xlayer.tech
